# Frontend conventions

- React function components + React Router routes in `frontend/src/App.jsx`.
- Protect dashboards with `ProtectedRoute` and `allowedRoles`.
- HTTP: import `api` from `config/api.js`; domain calls in `services/*.js` (candidate, company, recruiter, team).
- UI primitives live in `components/ui/` (shadcn-style); compose feature UI under `components/{candidate,company,recruiter,dashboard,home,layout,auth}/`.
- Role dashboards: `CandidateDashboard`, `RecruiterDashboard`, `CompanyDashboard`.
- Styling: Tailwind + existing utility patterns (`cn` from `lib/utils.js`); reuse icons already in the project.
- Do not invent a second Axios client or auth storage key — use `auth` in `localStorage`.
- Keep page shells thin; put forms and widgets in `components/`.
